  Slug: runaway-noble
  DisplayName: Runaway Noble
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: There are many reasons for noble blood to abandon their responsibilities.
    Whether you fled for safety, for love, to sate a spontaneous spark of rebellion,
    or to escape unbearable expectations, you've left your lavish life behind for
    one of newfound experiences. However, how prepared you are for a life on the
    road is something else entirely. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to
    Charisma or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in Diplomacy, and either Genealogy Lore or Heraldry Lore. You gain the Bon Mot
    skill feat.
